  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: cbdfddbb1a7e9dedeeccda6985376314, type: 3}
  m_Name:
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  itemId: 174
  indentLevel: 1
  storyText: 不错，这《造化逆天术》的原理乃是利用他人飞升渡劫时引动的仙灵之气重铸肉身。
